      },
      "text": "11.2.5  Resource exit",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.22352941675123825,
        "y0": 0.5400000184473366,
        "x1": 0.8925989936379826,
        "y1": 0.5525757760712595
      },
      "text": "If you want to prevent ACIF from collecting a specific type of resource, such as overlays, you",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.22352941675123825,
        "y0": 0.555151302405078,
        "x1": 0.35381825764973956,
        "y1": 0.567727060029001
      },
      "text": "can use the ACIF",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.35372550814759496,
        "y0": 0.555151302405078,
        "x1": 0.4108815909990298,
        "y1": 0.567727060029001
      },
      "text": "restype",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.41539215885735803,
        "y0": 0.5551515335988517,
        "x1": 0.8714868882123161,
        "y1": 0.5677272912227747
      },
      "text": "parameter. However, if you want to prevent ACIF from writing a",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.22352869370404413,
        "y0": 0.5703028175565932,
        "x1": 0.6494407903135212,
        "y1": 0.5828785751805161
      },
      "text": "specific resource to the resource file, use the resource exit.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.22352869370404413,
        "y0": 0.5981052945358585,
        "x1": 0.8803062688291462,
        "y1": 0.6106810521597814
      },
      "text": "The resource exit is best used to control resources at the file name level. For example, you",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.22352869370404413,
        "y0": 0.6132565784935999,
        "x1": 0.8597352270986519,
        "y1": 0.6258323361175229
      },
      "text": "want to exclude particular fonts from the resource file. You can code this exit program to",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.22352869370404413,
        "y0": 0.6284078624513414,
        "x1": 0.8941980499068117,
        "y1": 0.6409836200752643
      },
      "text": "contain a table of the fonts that you want to exclude and filter them from the resource file. The",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.22352869370404413,
        "y0": 0.6435591464090828,
        "x1": 0.6342436347911561,
        "y1": 0.6561349040330058
      },
      "text": "program that is invoked at this exit is defined in the ACIF",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6341166776769301,
        "y0": 0.6435591464090828,
        "x1": 0.691272760528365,
        "y1": 0.6561349040330058
      },
      "text": "resexit",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6957843256931678,
        "y0": 0.6435604950394294,
        "x1": 0.7738076004327512,
        "y1": 0.6561362526633523
      },
      "text": "parameter.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.22352894303066279,
        "y0": 0.6713629720186947,
        "x1": 0.6548309824825113,
        "y1": 0.6839387296426176
      },
      "text": "ACIF does not start the exit for the following resource types:",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.24705861908158447,
        "y0": 0.6928021293697935,
        "x1": 0.8943379470725464,
        "y1": 0.7053778869937164
      },
      "text": "Page definitions: The pagedef is a required resource for converting line data to AFP and it",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.24705861908158447,
        "y0": 0.7079533940613871,
        "x1": 0.5109725652956495,
        "y1": 0.7205291516853101
      },
      "text": "is never included in the resource file.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.24705861908158447,
        "y0": 0.7294679976472951,
        "x1": 0.8943202947479447,
        "y1": 0.742043755271218
      },
      "text": "Form definitions: The formdef is a required resource for processing print files. If you do not",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.24705861908158447,
        "y0": 0.7446192623388888,
        "x1": 0.8641456903195849,
        "y1": 0.7571950199628117
      },
      "text": "want the formdef to be included in the resource file, specify restype=none or explicitly",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.24705864401424632,
        "y0": 0.7597705270304824,
        "x1": 0.45887302573210276,
        "y1": 0.7723462846544054
      },
      "text": "exclude the formdef from the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.458921843884038,
        "y0": 0.7597705270304824,
        "x1": 0.5159802904316023,
        "y1": 0.7723462846544054
      },
      "text": "restype",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5160779267354728,
        "y0": 0.7597705270304824,
        "x1": 0.5449831096175449,
        "y1": 0.7723462846544054
      },
      "text": "list.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.24705861908158447,
        "y0": 0.7812096843815813,
        "x1": 0.8941428739261004,
        "y1": 0.7937854420055043
      },
      "text": "Coded fonts: If you specify MCF2REF=CF, ACIF writes coded fonts to the resource file if they",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2470585692162607,
        "y0": 0.796360949073175,
        "x1": 0.3850094664330576,
        "y1": 0.8089367066970979
      },
      "text": "are included in the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3849996928296058,
        "y0": 0.796360949073175,
        "x1": 0.44215577568104064,
        "y1": 0.8089367066970979
      },
      "text": "restype",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.44215577568104064,
        "y0": 0.796360949073175,
        "x1": 0.8670848771637562,
        "y1": 0.8089367066970979
      },
      "text": "list. The default is MCF2REF=CPCS; therefore, ACIF does not",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.24705854428359886,
        "y0": 0.8115122137647687,
        "x1": 0.5179738562091504,
        "y1": 0.8240879713886916
      },
      "text": "write coded fonts to the resource file.",
      "html": null,
